{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":486881,"name":"Channels Cintara","username":"Channels_Cintara","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/b782af/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-08T23:32:29.340Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/f/af21e22ed7baac8581b938fb218402fa205fde19.png\" data-download-href=\"/uploads/short-url/oZi9s1kj2ihGqjkt3XLqwyT1WRP.png?dl=1\" title=\"image\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/a/f/af21e22ed7baac8581b938fb218402fa205fde19_2_690x42.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"oZi9s1kj2ihGqjkt3XLqwyT1WRP\" width=\"690\" height=\"42\" srcset=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/a/f/af21e22ed7baac8581b938fb218402fa205fde19_2_690x42.png, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/a/f/af21e22ed7baac8581b938fb218402fa205fde19_2_1035x63.png 1.5x, https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/optimized/3X/a/f/af21e22ed7baac8581b938fb218402fa205fde19_2_1380x84.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"261A1B\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"meta\"\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#far-image\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003cspan class=\"filename\"\u003eimage\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"informations\"\u003e1750×109 6.98 KB\u003c/span\u003e\u003csvg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cuse href=\"#discourse-expand\"\u003e\u003c/use\u003e\u003c/svg\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI am getting this error again and again I have tried logging out and in and even reinstalled the grok bot but still getting this error. Can anyone help?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-08T23:54:12.417Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":21,"reads":12,"readers_count":11,"score":107.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":171107,"topic_slug":"authentication-error-try-logging-in","display_username":"Channels Cintara","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-windows-0-44-0-authentication-error-persists-after-update-logout-login-and-cache-clear/171115","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot (Windows 0.44.0): Authentication error persists after update, logout/login, and cache clear","clicks":10}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136910,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/authentication-error-try-logging-in/171107/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":488337,"name":"Dean Rie","username":"deanrie","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/deanrie/{size}/1263_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-10T18:30:26.737Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/channels_cintara\"\u003e@Channels_Cintara\u003c/a\u003e. I can see the screenshot with the banner: “Authentication error / If you are logged in, try logging out and back in”.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYour session is fine. There’s nothing else you need to do on the login side, and reinstalling won’t help. Signing out and back in won’t fix this one. This isn’t caused by your setup. The message is showing up because of a recent change on our side that’s preventing some Grok Bot computers from reaching the model. I’ve already flagged it to the team and we’re tracking it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you don’t want to wait for the fix, you can update Grok Bot’s Computer to a newer build that isn’t affected:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eGo to Settings, then Grok Bot’s Computer.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eClick Update and wait for it to finish. Your bots and files will stay in place.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSend a test message to the bot.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf Update doesn’t work, or if the error is still there after step 4, reply here and I’ll reset your Grok Bot machine from my side. I’ll keep your bots and data. I’ll also update the thread as soon as we have news on the fix.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-10T18:30:26.737Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":0.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":171107,"topic_slug":"authentication-error-try-logging-in","display_username":"Dean Rie","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"","bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":750,"hidden":false,"trust_level":4,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/authentication-error-try-logging-in/171107/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_ans